| Operator     | Purpose                                   | Example                     |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |
| `$in`        | Match ANY value                           | `$in:["react","python"]`    |
| `$all`       | Match ALL values                          | `$all:["react","node"]`     |
| `$size`      | Exact array length                        | `$size:3`                   |
| `$elemMatch` | One element satisfies multiple conditions | `$elemMatch:{...}`          |
| `$push`      | Add element                               | `$push:{skills:"node"}`     |
| `$addToSet`  | Add without duplicates                    | `$addToSet:{skills:"node"}` |
| `$each`      | Add multiple elements                     | `$each:["node","react"]`    |
| `$position`  | Choose insertion index                    | `$position:2`               |
| `$slice`     | Limit elements kept                       | `$slice:-5`                 |
| `$pop`       | Remove first/last element                 | `$pop:{skills:1}`           |
| `$pull`      | Remove matching elements                  | `$pull:{skills:"react"}`    |



$in
"Does the array contain ANY of these?"

$all
"Does the array contain ALL of these?"

$size
"How many elements are in the array?"

$elemMatch
"Does ONE object satisfy all these conditions?"

$push
"Add something."

$addToSet
"Add something, but don't duplicate it."

$each
"Add multiple things."

$position
"Where should I insert them?"

$slice
"How many should I keep?"

$pop
"Remove the first or last element."

$pull
"Remove elements matching this value/condition."
